WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.407
Before creating a static pivot, inspect the category values.

00:00:04.407 --> 00:00:08.192
This script lists distinct diagnoses and products.

00:00:08.192 --> 00:00:14.447
If the current data includes categories you did not plan for, a fixed pivot may omit them.

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:18.112
Discovery helps make the schema decision explicit.

00:00:18.112 --> 00:00:24.647
Connect this idea to a BI dashboard turning monthly categories into presentation columns.

00:00:24.647 --> 00:00:30.422
Ask what could go wrong if the concept were misunderstood: could rows be duplicated,

00:00:30.422 --> 00:00:38.622
important records disappear, categories be interpreted incorrectly, or a report become difficult to reproduce?

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:44.527
A strong analyst can explain both the SQL operation and the assumption behind it.

00:00:44.527 --> 00:00:50.560
After the example, summarize the idea in one plain-language sentence before moving on.
